# Compiled browser SPA — NOT committed (avoids git bloat from the ~1.2MB bundle
# changing every build). The escapement server resolves the bundle on demand:
# classpath (release jar / local `bb build-ui`) → ~/.cache → GitHub release asset
# (verified against the SHA-256 in the committed resources/escapement-ui.edn).
# Only resources/public/index.html and resources/escapement-ui.edn are committed.
resources/public/js/
